<title>UK: EIB sets 300 million stg December 2003 bond.</title>
<headline>EIB sets 300 million stg December 2003 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN STG   COUPON     **	  MATURITY    08.DEC.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE   L15.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  30 BP     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+3 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	**TO BE PRICED</p>
<p>		L LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 8.0 PCT 2003 GILT</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
